her than inventing an injury or a safety guarantee.\",\"experienceReview\":\"Reuse the existing practice:bark-extraction source only when a paid completed operation satisfies its registered qualified practice-confirmed milestone conditions: actor-specific amount 0.4, cap 0.5, hold duration 8 rounds, refresh repetition and 12-round cooldown; maintained gain 0.02 and decay 0.001 under its existing participation conditions. This feedback reflects grounded progress with actual changed material, not requesting, studying, mastery or every repeated peel. A genuinely new experimentally confirmed finding may separately use the existing grounded-understanding rule through probe; ordinary assessment must not automatically count as new information. No additional alias-based pleasure or satisfaction source is needed, and obtaining bark alone does not improve health, nutrition or physical comfort.\",\"visualReview\":\"Reuse the registered bark-assessed, bark-peeling-started, bark-peeling-progress, bark-peeling-completed and bark-peeling-stopped event bindings. Show actual assessed suitability, paid progress, remaining work, conserved bark/fines/core quantities and tool reservations in the process display and replay. Render only actual resulting inventory or ground items; do not display a completed drying tray, stripped standing tree or bark reward before those physical changes occur.\",\"learning\":2}]}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}}

